   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved framework conditions for sustainable development</narrative>
   </title>
   <reference code="269615" vocabulary="99"></reference>
   <indicator aggregation-status="0" ascending="1" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">SSC contributions in 2019 to framework conditions within efficient healthcare management in Brazil: &quot;5 &quot;.

Score from 1-5, 1 lowest and 5 highest.

The planned output targets in the project have been met in 2019.

In sum, the Danish partners positively influence strategic decisions, reform initiatives and major change processes in BMoH and ANVISA thereby supporting improved framework conditions for pharmaceuticals on the Brazilian marked. Furthermore, the SSC phase 2 will further support ANVISA&#x2019;s implementation of ICH.</narrative>
    </title>
